<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's Sankorp says in talks with 3 companies.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Sankorp says in talks with 3 companies.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sankorp Ltd said on Thursday talks between itself New Africa Investments Ltd (Nail), New Africa Finance Holdings Ltd (Nafhold) and Metropolitan Life Ltd (Metlife) were still in progress.</p>
<p>Shareholders of Nail, Nafhold and Metlife were urged to exercise caution in their share dealings as the talks could have an impact on their share prices.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
